  annotation = {中文辅助译名：基于用户体验的高精度车门关闭耳压舒适度仿真模型研究},
  abstract = {The door system is the system most frequently used by consumers. With the improvement of vehicle manufacturing accuracy and vehicle sealing level, the problem of ear pressure in the passenger compartment becomes prominent at the moment of closing the door. This paper analyses the influencing factors of human ear comfort. Based on STAR CCM+ overlapping grid technology, an analysis model of door closing ear pressure is established. The simulation analysis results show that the effective leakage area of airflow channel and relief valve is the main influencing factor of door closing ear pressure. The real vehicle test data shows that the simulation accuracy of this model can reach 96.81%, which can effectively analyses and prevent door closing ear pressure problems.},
}

